{"id": 3824, "title": "Doctor and Fisherman", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "doctor-and-fisherman", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/3824_doctor-and-fisherman.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一天，一个博士坐船欣赏风景。在船上，博士问渔夫：”你会数学吗？”渔夫说不会，博士就说：”那你的生命就要失去四分之一了。”", "过了一会儿，博士又问：”你会哲学吗？”渔夫还是回答不会。博士又说：”那你的生命又要失去四分之一了。”", "几分钟后，博士又问了：”你会科学吗？”渔夫仍然不会。", "就在这时，突然刮起了大风，渔夫问博士：”你会游泳吗？”博士说不会，渔夫说：”那你的生命可能就要结束了！”"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一天，一個博士坐船欣賞風景。在船上，博士問漁夫：”你會數學嗎？”漁夫說不會，博士就說：”那你的生命就要失去四分之一了。”", "過了一會兒，博士又問：”你會哲學嗎？”漁夫還是回答不會。博士又說：”那你的生命又要失去四分之一了。”", "幾分鐘後，博士又問了：”你會科學嗎？”漁夫仍然不會。", "就在這時，突然刮起了大風，漁夫問博士：”你會游泳嗎？”博士說不會，漁夫說：”那你的生命可能就要結束了！”"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī tiān， yī gè bó shì zuò chuán xīn shǎng fēng jǐng。 zài chuán shàng， bó shì wèn yú fū：” nǐ huì shù xué ma？” yú fū shuō bù huì， bó shì jiù shuō：” nà nǐ de shēng mìng jiù yào shī qù sì fēn zhī yī le。”", "guò le yī huì r， bó shì yòu wèn：” nǐ huì zhé xué ma？” yú fū hái shi huí dá bù huì。 bó shì yòu shuō：” nà nǐ de shēng mìng yòu yào shī qù sì fēn zhī yī le。”", "jǐ fēn zhōng hòu， bó shì yòu wèn le：” nǐ huì kē xué ma？” yú fū réng rán bù huì。", "jiù zài zhè shí， tū rán guā qǐ le dà fēng， yú fū wèn bó shì：” nǐ huì yóu yǒng ma？” bó shì shuō bù huì， yú fū shuō：” nà nǐ de shēng mìng kě néng jiù yào jié shù le！”"], "english_paragraphs": ["One day, a man with a doctorate was taking a boat ride to enjoy the scenery. On the boat, he asked the fisherman, “Do you know mathematics?” The fisherman said no, so the man replied, “Then you’ve lost a quarter of your life.”", "After a while, the man asked again, “Do you know philosophy?” The fisherman said no again. “Then you’ve lost another quarter of your life,” the man said.", "A few minutes later, the man asked, “Do you know science?” The fisherman didn’t know that either.", "Just then, a strong wind suddenly sprang up. The fisherman asked the man, “Can you swim?” The man said no, and the fisherman replied, “Then your life may be about to end!”"], "english_full": "One day, a man with a doctorate was taking a boat ride to enjoy the scenery. On the boat, he asked the fisherman, “Do you know mathematics?” The fisherman said no, so the man replied, “Then you’ve lost a quarter of your life.”\n\nAfter a while, the man asked again, “Do you know philosophy?” The fisherman said no again. “Then you’ve lost another quarter of your life,” the man said.\n\nA few minutes later, the man asked, “Do you know science?” The fisherman didn’t know that either.\n\nJust then, a strong wind suddenly sprang up. The fisherman asked the man, “Can you swim?” The man said no, and the fisherman replied, “Then your life may be about to end!”", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī tiān\" data-defn=\"one day; a day\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">一天</span><span class=\"tr\">一天</span><rt>yī tiān</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bó shì\" data-defn=\"doctor (as an academic degree)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">博士</span><span class=\"tr\">博士</span><rt>bó shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò\" data-defn=\"to sit / to take a seat / to take (a bus, airplane etc) / to bear fruit\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chuán\" data-defn=\"boat / vessel / ship\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">船</span><span class=\"tr\">船</span><rt>chuán</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xīn shǎng\" data-defn=\"to appreciate; to enjoy; to admire\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">欣赏</span><span class=\"tr\">欣賞</span><rt>xīn shǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=